    "id": "BD-108",
    "title": "Setup IMI Daily partnership.",
    "project": "BD",
    "status": "todo",
    "jiraStatus": "To Do",
    "priority": "Medium",
    "assignee": "Fotis Fotinias",
    "description": "```\nDear Victor and Fotis,\n\nHow are you? We've received your payment and confirmed your IMI Official Partner membership. Congratulations! 🎉 \n \nI'm Matt Muller, your Partnership Concierge, and I will handle all communications related to your Official Partner membership from here. To complete your onboarding process, please help us out with the following items:\n \nOfficial Partner Profile - we've already created your Official Partner Profile for our website, which you can view here. Please let us know if there are any updates you'd like us to make. \n\n 3x IMI Pro Profiles (TOP PRIORITY) — Included in your Official Partner benefits are 3 IMI Pro profiles and full-access accounts. Please confirm their names and emails with me, so I can create their IMI Pro Accounts, after which each team member can set up their details. I'll send further instructions once I have these. \n\nHere's what an example IMI Pro profile looks like.\n\n4x Sponsored Features - Included in your partnership are 4 sponsored feature articles per year (1 per quarter). Plus, we use advanced tracking to share performance and lead data in a Sponsorship Dashboard. My colleague @Ahmad Abbas and I will reach out to plan your first piece.\n\n4x IMI Connect Passes - included are 2 tickets to each of our 2 annual IMI Connect events. We'll also promote your brand and Official Partner membership status at these events. Who would you like to send to Barcelona June 2nd-4th? Here's some more info about the event.\n\nOfficial Partner Website Placement - Your logo and Official Partner profile has been added to three high-traffic website pages, including the home, Official Partner, and About IMI pages. If you have any specific brand kits/ logos you'd prefer us to use, please send them through. \n\nArticle Side banner Ad - We'll feature an SHD ad alongside our articles for your first 12 months of membership. We can advise on design, and you can change it as you wish. Do you have anything in particular you'd like to promote at the moment? We'll send some ideas thereafter.\n\nIntroductions at 0% Commission - IMI regularly fields questions and requests from potential applicants to your relevant programs. We'll start to introduce them to you without any required commission.\n\nOfficial Partner Badge - As an Official Partner, you're part of an illustrious, prestigious group of investment migration companies, and your investors and clients should know this. Use the attached Official Partner badges (linked here) on your website and marketing materials to show your credibility in the industry and signal you're a trusted company in this space.\n \n@James Nuveen, @Ahmad Abbas, @Christian Henrik Nesheim and the rest of the IMI team, and I are here to help make this a great, long-lasting partnership. Let us know if you have any questions, suggestions, or concerns at all as you start to take advantage of all the benefits to which you now have access.\n \nThanks again and congratulations!\n```\n\n‌\n\n```\nDear Victor and Fotis,\n\nHope you're both well! Just circling back on my previous email. Happy to help with anything if you have questions.\n\nWhen you get a moment, the main thing we need from you to get started is the names and emails of the 3 team members you'd like us to set up with IMI Pro accounts.\n\nLooking forward to getting SHD fully set up in the IMI Community!\n\nKind Regards,\n\nMatt Muller\n```",
