    "description": "Hello Matt,\n\nIt was nice talking to you and Ahmad, thanks for your time.  \n\n‌\n\nPlease find below some short answers to your questions so they will be used for the welcome article.\n\n‌\n\nKindly send me a draft version of it before you publish it.\n\n‌\n\nAs discussed, I will work on our first article and come back with a skeleton or a draft version. \n\n‌\n\nThanks.\n\n‌\n\n> {\n>\n> ‌\n>\n> Who Smart Homes is Smart Homes is a Greek luxury real estate developer led by founder Victor Stavropoulos, with a track record of more than 200 completed projects. We design and deliver residences that combine Mediterranean character with modern engineering — built for people who want a home in Greece that performs as well as it looks.\n>\n> ‌\n>\n> What Smart Homes does We develop and sell residential properties across Athens' most sought-after locations, with a particular focus on homes that qualify for the Greek Golden Visa and other residency-by-investment programs. Every property is delivered turnkey, with smart-home automation, energy-efficient systems, and the build quality international buyers expect.\n>\n> ‌\n>\n> Who Smart Homes works with We work with international investors, family offices, and private clients seeking a second home, a residency pathway, or a long-term asset in Greece. Our international footprint includes trusted partners across all major markets — Europe, Middle East, Asia, and America — supported by a network of immigration lawyers, tax advisors, and citizenship & residency consultants who guide clients end-to-end.\n>\n> ‌\n>\n> Why Smart Homes joined IMI IMI is the global meeting point for the investment migration industry, and Greece remains one of the most attractive Golden Visa destinations in the world. Joining IMI lets us connect directly with the professionals advising the clients we serve, share market intelligence, and contribute to raising standards across the industry.\n>\n> ‌\n>\n> How IMI professionals can engage with Smart Homes We welcome introductions from IMI members whose clients are exploring Greek residency through real estate investment. We can provide qualifying property shortlists, full due-diligence packs, virtual or in-person viewings, and end-to-end transaction support — and we offer structured referral arrangements for advisors. Reach out via [www.shd.global](http://www.shd.global/) to start a conversation.\n\n‌\n\nBest Regards,",
    "issueType": "Sub-task",
