    "assignee": "Unassigned",
    "description": "1. all numeric columns (ενδεικτικα Εμβαδον, Τιμη, τιμη\\_ανα\\_τετραγωνικο) convert from strings to numeric => DONE\n2. same with dates i.e. “Δημιουργια“ => DONE\n3. extract from “Υποτιτλο“ string part and put it in a separate column. We can call it “Τυπος Ακινητου“ => DONE\n4. merge all same tables with different endings (“\\_dd_mm_yyyy“) into one table. Add a column with the snapshot / timestamp => DONE\n5. clean dublicates => DONE\n6. add indexes for faster quering (replica database) => DONE\n7. Backup before the operations => DONE (24/03/2025)\n8. Backup after the operations => DONE (24/03/2025)\n9. added views to xrush_eukairia database (replica) => DONE \n10. add ID to each table (as PK (will be useful for replication, additionally for joining things) (a must to do) => DONE \n11. add replicated database (utilizing the same mssql server instace that officially is not recommended by microsoft, but we do it due to lack of resources) for reading operations (in order avoid locking the production table) => DONE \n\n‌\n\n‌\n\nThe scope of this project is database optimization in general.",
